\subsection{Decomposing the Detach Degradation}
\label{sec:why_detach}

Detach OCC falls 3.4\,pp below Vanilla despite identical architecture and forward computation to Full OCC. Two mechanistically distinct pathways contribute: (1)~the auxiliary head's BatchNorm2d layers update running statistics at every forward pass regardless of gradient routing, causing representational drift (CKA drops to 0.31--0.54); (2)~\texttt{stop\_gradient} blocks auxiliary gradients from reaching the encoder, removing behavioral regularization.

